contentMarkdown:
This passport holder will be your travel companion allowing you to store your transportation card, your passport and many other useful documents such as your roadmap or receipts.

It has 6 card spaces, and 3 pockets, one of which is for your passport.

This prototype has a few flaws here and there, that's why it is offered at a price of 40€ instead of the usual 120€. It is nevertheless strong, these defects are only visual.

